# Guess That Tune playlist backups

Backups are generated by the backup tool in the `spotify-explore` app.

## Start the app

From the `spotify-explore` repository:

```sh
npm ci
cp .env.example .env.local
```

Set `VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID` in `.env.local`, then start the app:

```sh
npm run dev
```

Open <http://127.0.0.1:8080/backup> and sign in with the owner Spotify account.

## Create the backups

Paste these playlist IDs into the backup tool:

```text
69B0Fg4RltQUdC5JJKH11m
23nFRTPMFPAEX5UJohI8Xx
6QAKnenuZoowNqxRzZbeRg
5mhjf1Y4CSWX8i02vp0idf
6G4aQ4pcQVKSR7KavEd5Sd
5g6juK6pZSVQs8v8PFMX46
7KYF90J2KSpfyPS2fQzxsg
2t3V6Xyhc6rnZkjNG38itg
```

Click **Download Backup Files**, then copy the downloaded files into this
repository, replacing the previous versions. Review the changes before
committing them.
